flowchart TB
  accTitle: Check permission before sharing across a boundary
  accDescr: For a proposed recipient and purpose, check handling, permitted actions, redistribution and reuse terms. If permission is missing or unclear, hold the exchange and clarify with the originator or policy owner. If permitted, check distribution settings, sharing groups and synchronization filters. Correct mismatches before sharing selected information with provenance and markings intact.

  item["Information + intended<br/>recipient and purpose"]:::accent
  policy{"Do handling, action,<br/>redistribution and reuse<br/>rules permit the exchange?"}
  hold["Hold the exchange;<br/>clarify with the originator<br/>or policy owner"]:::caution
  controls{"Do distribution settings,<br/>sharing groups and sync<br/>filters match the policy?"}
  adjust["Correct controls<br/>before sending"]:::caution
  share["Share selected information;<br/>preserve provenance<br/>and markings"]:::success

  item -->|Review applicable terms| policy
  policy -->|No or unclear| hold
  policy -->|Yes| controls
  controls -->|No| adjust
  adjust -->|Recheck| controls
  controls -->|Yes| share
